# The roots a board trusts for its connection to GitHub, for updates pulled from a release
# (planning/esp32-ota.md, O10, "TLS on the board"). Public certificates from ESP-IDF's own bundle
# (components/mbedtls/esp_crt_bundle/cacrt_all.pem). github.com's chain ends at USERTrust ECC, the CDN's
# (release-assets.githubusercontent.com) at ISRG Root X1, and DigiCert Global Root G2 is the spare
# (an authority GitHub has used for its hosts). This is not the firmware's signing trust: the anchors a
# signed update index must chain to are the project's own (ICLFORGE_EXAMPLE_TRUST_ANCHORS).

